{"site":"douban","sid":"1484675","imdb_id":"tt6769948","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt6769948/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/1484675/","chinese_title":"苗苗","foreign_title":"","year":"1980","aka":["The Young Teacher"],"region":["中国大陆"],"genre":["儿童"],"language":["汉语普通话"],"playdate":["1980"],"episodes":"","duration":"84分钟","description":"被分配到实验小学当老师的韩苗苗（李羚 饰）向陈校长（江颜辉 饰）报到，校长让她先到三（2）班听课。该班原来的老师方玉（朱玉蓉 饰）被淘气的学生气跑，听课的苗苗被迫登上讲台，但孩子们的恶作剧并未收敛，她极力克制内心情绪，耐心地对孩子们说：从今天起我是你们的老师，不过我还想成为你们的朋友。她的言传身教很快使班风得到良好转变，但许培培（关强 饰）的父母帮孩子做家庭作业；包司令（张钟英 饰）的孙子包瑞（马忱 饰）有很强的政治优越感，不好好学习。几经劝诫无果，一度使苗苗产生调离念头。但三（2）班孩子们真诚的挽留，最终打动了苗苗......\n本片获得文化部1980年优秀影片奖。同年获印度第二届国际儿童电影节最佳儿童影片奖。 1981年获第一届中国电影金鸡奖特别奖。","poster":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p2495353026.jpg","douban_votes":"1990","douban_rating":"7.7","imdb_rating_average":"6.1","imdb_votes":"17","imdb_rating":"6.1 / 10 from 17 users","director":[{"name":"王君正 Junzheng Wang","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27533405/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1378184969.47.webp"},{"name":"么文茹 Wenru Yao","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/35306066/","role":"副导演 Assistant Director","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"}],"writer":[{"name":"康丽雯 Liwen Kang","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27566038/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1433677644.29.webp"}],"cast":[{"name":"李羚 Ling Li","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27518276/","role":"饰 韩苗苗","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1351835222.62.webp"},{"name":"江韵辉 Yunhui Jiang","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27562911/","role":"饰 陈校长","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1495359979.75.webp"},{"name":"王佳宁 Jianing Wang","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27483650/","role":"饰 杨小亮","avatar":"https://im